{"id":"poucos","lemma":"poucos","pos":"pron","rank":1009,"glosses":["few (not many things or people)"],"ipa":"/ˈpo(w).kus/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/99/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-poucos.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-poucos.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ele tem poucos amigos.","en":"He has few friends.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"friend","l":"amigo"}]},{"text":"Eu tenho poucos amigos.","en":"I have few friends.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"friend","l":"amigo"}]},{"text":"Poucos minutos depois a polícia chegou.","en":"A few minutes later, the police arrived.","words":[null,{"g":"minute","l":"minuto"},{"g":"later"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"police"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"chegar"}]},{"text":"Poucos minutos depois, o telefone tocou.","en":"A few minutes later, the telephone rang.","words":[null,{"g":"minute","l":"minuto"},{"g":"later"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"telephone"},{"g":"to touch","l":"tocar"}]},{"text":"Eles têm poucos livros.","en":"They have few books.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"book","l":"livro"}]}]}